\f1\b0 \

\f0\b Dear Tesla Vehicle Software Engineering Team,
\f1\b0 \
My name is [Nimesi], and I am reaching out to present a high-fidelity algorithmic advancement in electric vehicle energy management: 
\f0\b Predictive Aero-Thermal Regenerative Braking (PTA-RB)
\f1\b0 .\
This system has been architected and refined in collaboration with 
\f0\b Google AI
\f1\b0 , utilizing large-scale physical modeling and electrochemical simulations. We are proposing a software-based efficiency leap that targets the fundamental "Regen Gap" in current EV firmware architectures.\
\
