\f0\b Technical Overview (Non-Confidential):
\f1\b0 \
The PTA-RB algorithm introduces a multi-layer predictive control logic designed for the Gateway ECU. Its core innovations include:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls1\ilvl0
\f0\b \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	1	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Dynamic Aerodynamic Decoupling:
\f1\b0  Instantaneous calculation of drag-induced deceleration to optimize motor recuperation loading at high velocities.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	2	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Sigmoidal Electrochemical Mapping:
\f1\b0  A non-linear battery acceptance model that eliminates abrupt regen cut-offs while providing internal induction heating for cold-start scenarios.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	3	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Active Gear-Lash Guard:
\f1\b0  A high-speed torque-crossing filter designed to eliminate drivetrain impulse loads and improve NVH metrics.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
